---
title: One player, retained memory and ordinary or semantic input
---
flowchart TD
  accTitle: Player decisions, historical memory and one mission writer
  accDescr: The user sets objectives and can Pause independently. The lead freezes admission and source, reviews evidence and verifies acceptance without ordinary gameplay rescue or routine memory curation. One designated player plans, interprets visible evidence and chooses physical input or optional semantic skills. The adapter uses the existing ingress, not another executor. Source-linked memory and asynchronous advisory proposals support decisions but grant no authority. One MissionRuntime writer retains original limits and exact custody; direct physical input permits visual drift while semantic shortcuts retain equivalence checks. Historical ACK delivery stays separate from actual current evidence.
  User["You: objective and boundaries"] --> Lead["Lead: admission and engineering<br/>Review and final verification"]
  Lead -->|"One finite assignment"| Player["Designated player<br/>Plan, explore, remember, verify"]
  Memory["Source-linked campaign memory<br/>Claims, Work, advice and executable routines<br/>Historical, never input authority"] --> Player
  Player -->|"Choose intent, source and limits"| Tools["Structured player tools<br/>Physical input or semantic shortcuts<br/>Official MCP SDK; no executor"]
  Tools -->|"Existing authenticated ingress"| Runtime["One MissionRuntime writer<br/>Original root and child limits"]
  Runtime -->|"Pinned player routine and current visible data"| Program["Bounded JavaScript step<br/>Branches and local calculations<br/>No host I/O or input capability"]
  Program -->|"Ordinary proposal or yield; no task-success proof"| Runtime
  Runtime --> Controller["Controller and native fences<br/>Exact lease, custody and deadlines<br/>Actual dispatch evidence"]
  Controller --> Game["Real windowed CDDA"]
  Game --> Evidence["Visible frames and receipts<br/>Historical ACK and separate current<br/>Actual effects and uncertainty"]
  Evidence --> Tools
  Tools -->|"Result, image and uncertainty"| Player
  Runtime --> Memory
  Runtime -.->|"Automatic trajectory feedback"| Adviser["Asynchronous adviser<br/>Revisable proposals with sources<br/>No input authority"]
  Adviser -.->|"Advice; play continues while pending"| Runtime
  Evidence --> Viewer["Observer: objective and progress<br/>Current versus historical context<br/>Unknown costs stay unknown"]
  Runtime --> Viewer
  User -->|"Pause stops new dispatch"| Controller
